    "description": "<p>Waterbury Center for Nursing and Rehabilitation is seeking a<em> remote part time </em>MDS Cordinator to join out team. <em>Must be located in CT.</em></p>\n<p>The primary purpose of this position is to plan, organize and direct the MDS department and process in accordance with federal and state guidelines and regulations that govern the center. The successful candidate will be a Registered Nurse in Connecticut with MDS experience and an unemcumbered licesnes to practice.&nbsp; We are seeking a candidate who will excel in working with OBRA assessments, Medicare PDPM and Case Mix Index.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>The candidate must be knowledgeable of nursing and medical practices and procedures, as well as laws, regulations and guidelines that pertain to long term care.&nbsp; In addition, the candidate must possess leadership and supervisory ability and willingness to work harmoniously with professional and line staff.</p>\n<p>CT licensed Lpn or RN&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hours :Part time 15 hours weekly</p>",
